            "description": {
              "value": "You have filed your teeth into jagged points and have an unusually powerful jaw, making your mouth a dangerous weapon. If you're an goblin, you gain a jaws unarmed attack that deals 1d4 piercing damage, and if you're a goblin, your jaws unarmed attack deals 1d8 piercing damage and loses the finesse trait. Whenever you score a critical hit with your jaws unarmed attack, your target takes 1 persistent bleed damage per weapon damage die."
